- content_for :page_header do
  = render "layouts/components/page_header", title: "Pôles"

.max-w-5xl.space-y-6
  p.text-sm.text-gray-500
    | Les pôles sont l'unité d'organisation des 4 Sources. Cliquez sur un pôle pour voir ses comptes (santé, budget, dépenses à valider), qui en est et ce qu'il décide.

  - if @rows.empty?
    .rounded-2xl.bg-white.px-6.py-10.text-center.text-sm.text-gray-500.ring-1.ring-gray-200
      | Aucun pôle pour l'instant.
  - else
    .grid.grid-cols-1.gap-4.sm:grid-cols-2.lg:grid-cols-3
      - @rows.each do |team|
        = link_to team_path(team), class: "block rounded-2xl bg-white p-5 ring-1 ring-gray-200 transition hover:ring-4s-main" do
          - if team.parent_id && team.parent
            .text-xs.text-gray-400 = "sous #{team.parent.name}"
          h2.mt-0.5.text-base.font-semibold.text-gray-900 = team.name
          - if team.kind
            span.mt-2.inline-flex.items-center.rounded-full.bg-teal-100.px-2.py-0.5.text-xs.font-medium.text-teal-800
              = team.kind_label

          - referents = team.referents
          .mt-3.text-sm.text-gray-600
            - if referents.any?
              span.text-gray-400 Référent·e·s :
              =< referents.map(&:name).join(", ")
            - else
              span.text-gray-400 Pas de référent·e

          - snapshot = @snapshots[team.id]
          - if snapshot
            .mt-3.rounded-lg.bg-gray-50.px-3.py-2
              .flex.items-baseline.justify-between.gap-2
                span.text-xs.text-gray-500 = "Résultat #{@year}"
                span.text-sm.font-semibold(class="#{snapshot.net_cents.negative? ? 'text-rose-700' : 'text-gray-900'}")
                  = team_euros(snapshot.net_cents, sign: true)
              - if snapshot.budget_percent
                .mt-1.flex.items-center.gap-2
                  .h-1.5.flex-1.rounded-full.bg-gray-200
                    .h-1.5.rounded-full(class="#{snapshot.budget_percent > 100 ? 'bg-rose-500' : 'bg-teal-500'}" style="width: #{[snapshot.budget_percent, 100].min}%")
                  span.text-xs.text-gray-500 = "#{snapshot.budget_percent} % des charges prévues"
              - else
                .mt-1.text-xs.text-gray-400 = "Pas de budget #{@year}"
              - if snapshot.to_validate_count.positive?
                .mt-1.text-xs.font-medium.text-amber-800
                  = "#{pluralize(snapshot.to_validate_count, 'facture', plural: 'factures')} à valider"

          .mt-3.flex.items-center.gap-2.text-xs.text-gray-500
            span.font-medium.text-gray-900 = team.team_memberships.size
            = "#{"membre".pluralize(team.team_memberships.size)}"
            - if team.analytic_code.present?
              span.text-gray-300 ·
              span.font-mono = team.analytic_code
